---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title = 'Studi Kasus Batam Dental Center | Adsbangda';
const description = 'Studi kasus Batam Dental Center — konten edukasi gigi dan kampanye Meta Ads yang hasilkan 185 percakapan calon pasien lewat WhatsApp.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} path="portofolio-batam-dental-center.html" portfolioCss={true}>
{ /* head-style slot: CSS khusus halaman ini (kalau ada) */ }
<Fragment slot="head-style">
<style>
.cd-summary{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3b3d3a;margin:28px 0 50px;text-align:justify;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img{width:100%;display:block;}

/* ---- case study: tools & software ---- */
.tools-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:40px 32px;margin-top:0;}

.tools-icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px 10px;}

.tool-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:100%;text-align:left;min-width:0;}
</style>
</Fragment>



<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="portofolio.html" class="back-link reveal" data-i18n="back_link" style="margin-bottom:22px;display:inline-flex;">&larr; Kembali ke Portofolio</a>
    <h1>Batam Dental Center</h1>
    <p data-i18n="hero_h2" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.5;">Bangun Kehadiran Digital Batam Dental Center di Media Sosial</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede1" style="margin:20px 0 0;">Adsbangda membantu Batam Dental Center membangun kehadiran digital melalui pengelolaan media sosial dan kampanye Meta Ads yang terarah, khusus buat klinik gigi yang mau lebih dikenal di Batam.</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede2" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Selama kerja sama berlangsung, kami berfokus pada peningkatan kepercayaan calon pasien, konsistensi konten edukasi kesehatan gigi, serta iklan yang tepat sasaran untuk mendukung pertumbuhan klinik.</p>

    <div class="hero-meta reveal">
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(244,228,9,.25);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3.5l8 4.3-8 4.3-8-4.3 8-4.3z" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 12.2l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 16.5l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k3">Layanan</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v3">Social Media Management, Meta Ads</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(255,74,61,.12);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="3.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k4">Platform</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v4">Instagram</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(27,75,67,.12);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M20.5 13.2L13 20.7a1.6 1.6 0 0 1-2.3 0l-7.2-7.2V4.3h9.2l7.2 7.2a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 .6 1.7z" stroke="#1B4B43" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="8.3" cy="8.3" r="1.4" fill="#1B4B43"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k5">Kategori</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v5">Digital Marketing &amp; Kesehatan</b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        <h2 data-i18n="about_label">Tentang Proyek</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p1" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Batam Dental Center merupakan klinik gigi yang berlokasi di Batam, melayani kebutuhan perawatan gigi untuk keluarga dan individu.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p2" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Adsbangda dipercaya sebagai partner digital marketing yang menangani pengelolaan konten media sosial dan kampanye Meta Ads, membantu klinik menjangkau lebih banyak calon pasien di sekitar Batam.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p3" style="margin:0;">Pendekatan ini membantu Batam Dental Center membangun citra profesional dan terpercaya di media sosial, sekaligus menjaga konsistensi konten edukasi seputar kesehatan gigi.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p1_h2">Konten Media Sosial &amp; Meta Ads untuk Klinik Gigi di Batam</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img src="assets/img/batam-dental-center-feed-reels.webp" alt="Contoh konten Instagram Feed dan Reels klinik gigi Batam Dental Center hasil kerja sama dengan Adsbangda" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p1_desc">Kami rutin memproduksi konten Instagram Feed dan Reels seputar layanan Batam Dental Center — mulai dari edukasi kesehatan gigi, before-after hasil perawatan, sampai momen di balik layar klinik — dipadukan dengan kampanye Meta Ads yang menyasar calon pasien di sekitar Batam, supaya klinik gigi ini makin gampang ditemukan dan dipercaya calon pasien baru.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl1">Konten edukasi &amp; before-after gigi</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl2">Feed &amp; Reels Instagram konsisten</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl3">Iklan Meta Ads tersegmentasi area Batam</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p2_h2">Kampanye Meta Ads untuk Dongkrak Booking Konsultasi Gigi</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img src="assets/img/batam-dental-center-meta-ads-manager.webp" alt="Dashboard Meta Ads Manager kampanye promo Ramadhan Batam Dental Center menampilkan hasil iklan link clicks, CPC, dan konversi WhatsApp" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p2_desc">Selain mengelola konten organik, kami menjalankan kampanye Meta Ads bertarget khusus untuk mempromosikan promo spesial Batam Dental Center — seperti Promo Ramadhan — dan mengarahkan calon pasien untuk langsung chat via WhatsApp.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p2_desc2">Setiap campaign dipantau langsung lewat Ads Manager, mulai dari CTR, cost per click, sampai cost per result, supaya budget iklan klinik terpakai efisien dan menghasilkan percakapan calon pasien yang nyata, bukan sekadar impresi kosong.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 6.5v3h2l4 3V3.5l-4 3H2z"/><path d="M10.5 5.3a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.4"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl1">414 Link Clicks &middot; CTR 2,64%</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="7.8" r="2.4"/><circle cx="11.2" cy="6" r="1.8"/><path d="M1.8 14c0-2.2 1.9-3.9 4.2-3.9s4.2 1.7 4.2 3.9"/><path d="M9.6 10.3c1.7.3 3 1.7 3 3.7"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl2">185 Konversi Chat WhatsApp</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2.2"/><path d="M8 1.5v2M8 12.5v2M1.5 8h2M12.5 8h2M3.3 3.3l1.4 1.4M11.3 11.3l1.4 1.4M12.7 3.3l-1.4 1.4M4.7 11.3l-1.4 1.4"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl3">Cost per Result &plusmn;Rp2.998 / Percakapan</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
      <h2 data-i18n="wf_label">Workflow Project</h2>
      <p data-i18n="wf_desc">Kami menerapkan proses kerja yang terstruktur untuk memastikan setiap aktivitas pemasaran digital berjalan efektif dan menghasilkan output yang konsisten.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wf-track reveal">
      <svg class="wf-connector" viewBox="0 0 1200 320" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M70,35 L600,35 L1130,35 C1200,35 1200,160 1130,160 L600,160 L70,160 C0,160 0,285 70,285 L600,285 L1130,285" stroke="rgba(21,23,27,.4)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="2 11" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="wf-grid">
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">01</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_1">Discovery</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">02</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_2">Research</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">03</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_3">Content Planning</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">04</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_4">Design</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">05</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_5">Campaign Setup</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">06</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_6">Publishing</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">07</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_7">Monitoring</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">08</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_8">Optimization</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">09</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_9">Reporting</h4></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

